    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizruntimedoc-List Rideshare Rides Historys-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Rideshare Rides History API provides access to a comprehensive log of rideshare trips, allowing users to retrieve their historical ride data efficiently. This API is designed for both drivers and passengers who need to view past trip details for audit, reporting, or personal tracking purposes. With endpoints simplifying the query of rides based on date or trip ID, this API facilitates transparency and enhances user experience in rideshare platforms. Developers can integrate this API to empower their applications with historical ride information, supporting features like expense tracking and ride analysis.",
